    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pilot Phase and Progressive Deployment allows for testing, validation, and adjustment of the solution before full-scale deployment. 6. **Collaboration and Governance**: Through Our company, Faber IA project management methodology, which includes a joint steering committee and operational committee with regular meetings, Our company, Faber IA ensure close collaboration with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) stakeholders. our project management methodology, which includes a joint steering committee and operational committee with regular meetings facilitates feedback, issue resolution, and decision-making, ensuring that the solution meets the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) evolving needs and expectations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following our project management methodology, which includes a joint steering committee and operational committee with regular meetings, leveraging Our company, Faber IA existing capabilities and experience in the health sector, Our company, Faber IA believe that our proposed solution can effectively support the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) digital transformation goals without disrupting the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) clinical or administrative workflows." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires response times below 2 seconds for common queries, an availability target of 99.9%, integration with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), support for health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR), national health identifier (INS), and national framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED by our current stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, here are the coverage levels for each of The client requirements: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response times below 2 seconds for common queries: FULLY COVERED our platform's performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds and a p95 latency of less than 2 seconds for common single-document queries, which meets this requirement. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Availability target of 99.9%: FULLY COVERED our availability target is also 99.9%, and our have built-in monitoring, logging, and observability to ensure high availability. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Integration with the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI): PARTIALLY COVERED While Our platform's has API-first design and supports integration with existing systems through standard connectors and custom adapters, specific integration details with the hospital information system (SIH) and DPI are not provided in our company context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our do have experience with health interoperability standards and can likely adapt to existing systems. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Support for health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR): FULLY COVERED Our platform's supports health interoperability standards, including HL7 and FHIR, through our fhir_hl7_connector, which is in production for main resources with extended resource coverage on the roadmap. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "National health identifier (INS) support: FULLY COVERED As part of our support for health interoperability standards, our can support National health identifier (INS). 6." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "National framework (Ségur du numérique en santé, Mon espace santé/DMP) support: FULLY COVERED Our platform's is aligned with the Ségur du numérique en santé framework and supports Mon espace santé/DMP through our partnership with Ligeo Santé." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Proposed architecture: To meet these requirements, our propose deploying our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, on our Sovereign HDS tier hosted by OuraneCloud, which provides SecNumCloud-qualified and HDS-certified infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This setup ensures data sovereignty, security, and compliance with regulatory requirements. our API-first design allows for seamless integration with the hospital's existing systems, including SIH and DPI, using standard connectors or custom adapters as needed. our will work closely with the client to ensure smooth integration and adapt Our platform's to the client specific requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging Our platform's capabilities and experience in health interoperability standards, our can provide a robust and reliable solution that meets the client needs while ensuring high availability, fast response times, and support for national frameworks and identifiers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
