    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given that the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) is a public regional hospital serving the Belval region with approximately 1,200 beds and 4,500 staff across medical, care, and medico-administrative functions, and considering the need for an AI assistance solution to improve the efficiency of the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) staff and the quality and safety of the care delivered to patients, how can we ensure that we proposed solution aligns with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) digital transformation goals and fits into the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) existing practices without introducing any rupture in clinical or administrative workflows?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, has experience working with public sector and health institutions, as evidenced by Our company, Faber IA past references, including a regional hospital group where Our company, Faber IA implemented an AI assistant for medical documentation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) specific needs and constraints, Our company, Faber IA propose leveraging Our company, Faber IA flagship product, Atelier, which is a sovereign platform that forges document-grounded AI assistants from an organisation's own documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure alignment with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) digital transformation goals and existing practices, Our company, Faber IA suggest the following approach:  1. **Hybrid Delivery Model**: Our company, Faber IA will adopt a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. a hybrid delivery model combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement will enable Our company, Faber IA to work closely with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) stakeholders throughout the project lifecycle. 2. **Integration with Existing Systems**: Our company, Faber IA solution, Atelier, can integrate with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), ensuring seamless interaction with existing clinical and administrative workflows. 3. **Customization and Training**: Our company, Faber IA will customize our proposed solution to fit the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) specific requirements, including supporting medical coding (PMSI, ICD 10) for activity reporting (T2A) and facilitating continuity of care between professionals and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA change management support includes staff training to ensure a smooth transition. 4. **Data Sovereignty and Security**: As Our company, Faber IA partner with OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider (SecNumCloud-qualified, HDS-certified), Our company, Faber IA can guarantee that the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) data is hosted within the European Union, ensuring compliance with GDPR and other regulatory requirements. 5. **Pilot Phase and Progressive Deployment**: To avoid any disruption in clinical or administrative workflows, Our company, Faber IA propose starting with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter (one or two departments) followed by progressive generalization to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

